Error [jet.InvalidEmbedPath]: `embed_file` path `../secret.txt` can't use `..`
  --> tests/ui/comptime_embed_computed_dotdot.jet:2:15
    |
  2 | D: #run embed_file("{UP}/secret.txt")
    |               ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Comptime inputs are named from this file's own directory down, so a build can audit them; `..` is refused in a computed path too
 Fix: Compute a path under this file's directory, without `..`
